#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/unity.rst:169
msgid ""
"If the ``unity_config.h`` is not found, PlatformIO will generate a default "
"``unity_config.h`` that routes test result output to a framework specified "
"in the :ref:`projectconf_env_framework`. On the :ref:`platform_native` "
"development platform, it will be the standard input/output, whereas, on the "
"embedded development platforms, the first available Serial interface will be "
"used (see `UNITY_FRAMEWORK_CONFIG <https://github.com/platformio/platformio-"
"core/blob/develop/platformio/test/runners/unity.py>`_ for the default "
"framework configurations)."
msgstr ""

